{
  "_comment": [
    "Shared receipt-URL normalization vectors, applied to two implementations",
    "of the same rule:",
    "  packages/cli/src/commands/verify_external.rs  (receipt_api_url)",
    "  packages/verify-js/src/index.ts               (receiptApiUrl)",
    "",
    "Both accept a receipt URL from a person and turn it into the JSON API",
    "URL to fetch. Through 0.31.9 each did a blind replace of `/receipt/`",
    "with `/v1/receipt/`, so the documented API form",
    "https://api.treeship.dev/v1/receipt/<id> became /v1/v1/receipt/ and got",
    "a 404 (0.31.9 full test, CLI-11).",
    "",
    "The rule: the path must name one session receipt. `/receipt/<id>` (the",
    "human page) maps to `/v1/receipt/<id>`; `/v1/receipt/<id>` and the",
    "site's `/api/receipt/<id>` mirror are already the JSON API and are kept.",
    "The host is never rewritten (the apex redirects to www itself). A",
    "trailing slash is dropped, the query string is kept, the fragment is",
    "dropped. Anything else is not a receipt URL and is refused, not fetched.",
    "",
    "The id must match [A-Za-z0-9_-]+, so `..`, `%2F` and a query never reach the request; the scheme is case-insensitive; userinfo is refused.",
    "`expect` is the URL to fetch, or null when the input must be refused."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {"name": "hub human path", "input": "http://localhost:18089/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406", "expect": "http://localhost:18089/v1/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406"},
    {"name": "hub api path", "input": "http://localhost:18089/v1/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406", "expect": "http://localhost:18089/v1/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406"},
    {"name": "documented api host", "input": "https://api.treeship.dev/v1/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406", "expect": "https://api.treeship.dev/v1/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406"},
    {"name": "www receipt page", "input": "https://www.treeship.dev/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406", "expect": "https://www.treeship.dev/v1/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406"},
    {"name": "apex receipt page", "input": "https://treeship.dev/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406", "expect": "https://treeship.dev/v1/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406"},
    {"name": "www api mirror", "input": "https://www.treeship.dev/api/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406", "expect": "https://www.treeship.dev/api/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406"},
    {"name": "trailing slash", "input": "https://www.treeship.dev/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406/", "expect": "https://www.treeship.dev/v1/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406"},
    {"name": "trailing slash on api", "input": "https://api.treeship.dev/v1/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406/", "expect": "https://api.treeship.dev/v1/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406"},
    {"name": "query string kept", "input": "https://api.treeship.dev/v1/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406?token=t1", "expect": "https://api.treeship.dev/v1/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406?token=t1"},
    {"name": "query string on page", "input": "https://www.treeship.dev/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406?utm=x", "expect": "https://www.treeship.dev/v1/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406?utm=x"},
    {"name": "fragment dropped", "input": "https://www.treeship.dev/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406#checks", "expect": "https://www.treeship.dev/v1/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406"},
    {"name": "self-hosted under a prefix", "input": "https://hub.example.com/treeship/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406", "expect": "https://hub.example.com/treeship/v1/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406"},
    {"name": "artifact page is not a receipt", "input": "https://www.treeship.dev/verify/art_23e6b18b1c0de245", "expect": null},
    {"name": "certificate file is not a receipt", "input": "https://example.com/researcher.agent.json", "expect": null},
    {"name": "no id", "input": "https://www.treeship.dev/receipt/", "expect": null},
    {"name": "no id on api", "input": "https://api.treeship.dev/v1/receipt", "expect": null},
    {"name": "path continues past the id", "input": "https://www.treeship.dev/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406/extra", "expect": null},
    {"name": "receipt in the host only", "input": "https://receipt.example.com/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406", "expect": null},
    {"name": "not http", "input": "ftp://hub.example.com/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406", "expect": null},
    {"name": "no host", "input": "https:///receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406", "expect": null},
    {"name": "uppercase scheme is normalized", "input": "HTTPS://api.treeship.dev/v1/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406", "expect": "https://api.treeship.dev/v1/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406"},
    {"name": "traversal in the id", "input": "https://www.treeship.dev/receipt/..", "expect": null},
    {"name": "encoded slash in the id", "input": "https://www.treeship.dev/receipt/ssn_x%2Fadmin", "expect": null},
    {"name": "encoded traversal in the id", "input": "https://api.treeship.dev/v1/receipt/..%2F..%2Fdock", "expect": null},
    {"name": "userinfo hides the real host", "input": "https://treeship.dev@evil.example/receipt/ssn_ed0fc8f61253a406", "expect": null},
    {"name": "query in the id position", "input": "https://www.treeship.dev/receipt/?id=ssn_x", "expect": null}
  ]
}
